   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The review",
     "texto": [
      "A **ulasan** (review) is an assessment of a work. It can include a summary, the standout qualities and a recommendation.",
      "**Meskipun** introduces a contrast (\"although\"); **sebaliknya**, an opposite idea (\"on the other hand\")."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Summarizing and evaluating",
     "texto": [
      "**Menyimpulkan** means to summarize a main idea. **Layak ditonton** means \"worth watching\". To write an opinion, separate the summary from your personal assessment."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
